From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:42:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] refactor(daemon-hosts): R8b step 6 website and desktop
 pass the executor one agentRuntime port; the per-member runtime options,
 executorDefinitionPolicies and the nested-copy getAgentDef/resolveAgentLaunch
 lines are deleted

agent-daemon-scope.ts and desktop-agent.ts bind createAgentRuntimeBindings({ runtime }) satisfies AgentRuntimePort and pass it as
`agentRuntime`; getAgentDef, resolveAgentLaunch, runtimeState, codexDisablePlugins, piGracefulShutdownMs and
executor-definition-policies.ts are gone. The nested-copy hazard comment is rewritten to say why the port exists. The two
failRunBeforeStart calls that carry a startup exception pass the runtime's startupMessage formatter. Tests: desktop-agent-runtime asserts the
bound port instead of the removed options; the typed-tools scope, the daemon-source helper, the finalizer test and the eval harness
follow the new signature.

